# ================================================================
# 19. PATIENT-LEVEL AGGREGATION
# ================================================================
#
# A patient may appear in multiple held-out sets.
#
# The final probability for that patient is the mean of all
# probabilities obtained when that patient was held out.
#
# ================================================================

